SUMMARY:The Bowery Presents: Kiefer
LOCATION:Arts at the Armory\, 191 Highland Ave\, Somerville\, MA 02143
DESCRIPTION:Kiefer is an American pianist\, producer\, and composer whose m
 usic bridges modern jazz\, hip-hop production\, and expressive solo piano 
 traditions. His work has earned the rare distinction of being signed to bo
 th Stones Throw Records and Blue Note Records\, two of the most influentia
 l labels in hip-hop and jazz\, signaling his legitimacy and impact in both
  scenes. A Grammy Award–winning producer for his contributions to Malibu
  by Anderson.Paak\, he has collaborated with artists including Dr. Dre\, K
 aytranada\, De La Soul\, Pete Rock\, Terrace Martin\, Kenny Beats\, Walter
  Smith III\, and Nate Smith. Drawing from influences ranging from Herbie H
 ancock to Los Angeles beat-makers like Madlib\, Kiefer’s music balances 
 technical sophistication with emotional immediacy\, pairing lush harmony w
 ith minimalist\, hypnotic grooves. New music is on the way later this year
  from him.\nhttps://artsatthearmory.org/events/the-bowery-presents-kiefer/
 \nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://artsatthearmory.org/events/the-bowery-presents-kiefer/
END:VEVENT
