SUMMARY:SUGAR
LOCATION:Roadrunner\, 89 Guest St\, Boston\, MA 02135
DESCRIPTION:with J. Robbins\nHaving already placed his indelible mark on mo
 dern music with Hüsker Dü and solo album Workbook\, Bob Mould enlisted b
 assist David Barbe and drummer Malcolm Travis leading to the formation of 
 SUGAR\, who made their live debut in early 1992 at Athens\, GA’s famed 4
 0 Watt Club. Named by NME as its 1992 Album of the Year\, SUGAR’s now-cl
 assic debut album\, Copper Blue\, immediately proved a sensation\, earning
  worldwide acclaim and landmark status for the melodic strength and intens
 ely cathartic popcraft of songs like “A Good Idea”\, “Helpless”\, 
 and the alternative rock radio hit and MTV favorite\, “If I Can’t Chan
 ge Your Mind”.\nhttps://www.axs.com/events/1300137/sugar-tickets\nFrom P
 ushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://www.axs.com/events/1300137/sugar-tickets
