SUMMARY:CLAUDIO SIMONETTI'S GOBLIN / TENEBRE
LOCATION:Somerville Theatre\, 55 Davis Square\, Somerville\, MA 02144
DESCRIPTION:Composer Claudio Simonetti has written and recorded some of the
  most influential scores and soundtracks in horror\, including Suspiria\, 
 Dawn of the Dead\, Deep Red Profondo Rosso\, Demons\, and many others\, wi
 th his seminal work still informing the genre to this day. This year\, Sim
 onettis Goblin celebrates Dario Argentos 1982 critically acclaimed classic
 \, Tenebre\, with a live performance of the score set to a screening of th
 e film. Following the finale of the movie\, the collective will return aft
 er a brief intermission to deliver an additional performance of quintessen
 tial Goblin material and best of songs and scores set to their cinematic c
 ounterparts\nhttps://www.ticketmaster.com/claudio-simonettis-goblin-tenebr
 e-somerville-massachusetts-10-25-2026/event/0100650DD82FA483\nFrom Pushpin
