SUMMARY:Vince Staples
LOCATION:Roadrunner\, 89 Guest St\, Boston\, MA 02135
DESCRIPTION:with Private School\nIt opens with the ephemeral sounds of natu
 re. Birds\, bugs\, and airy notes chiming in the air. Then\, the undercurr
 ent of something darker\, disrupting the fantasy: a distorted voice. “To
  live is to be\,” the voice says\, “Like the nigga in the tree.” Thi
 s is how Dark Times\, Vince Staples’ eighth studio album\, begins.\nhttp
 s://www.axs.com/events/1485214/vince-staples-tickets\nFrom Pushpin Boston:
  https://pushpin.city/boston/
